<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimates of major South African company results expected next week include the following (all figures cents per share):</p>
<p>DAY--COMPANY--------------PERIOD--CONSENSUS----RANGE-------PVS</p>
<p>TUE  JCI LTD    YR EPS  251.7	 239.0-268.0  192.0</p>
<p>TUE  JCI LTD    YR DIV   70.0	  60.0-80.0    40.0</p>
<p>WED  AVI LTD  AVIJnJ    YR EPS  164.0	 159.7-170.0  155.6</p>
<p>WED  AVI LTD  AVIJnJ    YR DIV   30.0	  29.0-31.0    28.0</p>
<p>NOTE - EPS for JCI is equity-accounted and previous div was maiden.</p>
<p>NOTE - EPS for AVI is pre-exceptionals.</p>
<p>				  ooOOoo</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
